## How to Use

**Step 1 – Clone**

```bash
git clone https://github.com/USERNAME/REPOSITORY.git
cd REPOSITORY
```

**Step 2 – Install dependency**

```bash
pip install requests
```

**Step 3 – Run**

```bash
python3 scanner.py
```

**Step 4 – Enter the target IP/domain when prompted.**

**Step 5 – View the scan results and vulnerability report.**

> Use only on systems you own or have permission to test.
